    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a surreal journey in <strong>Your World</strong>, a VR survival game that blends open-world exploration with a dreamlike, low-poly aesthetic. Immerse yourself in a vibrant landscape where every element is crafted to inspire creativity and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather and Craft</strong>: Collect resources from the environment to craft essential tools and structures. Chop trees, mine stones, and forge metal components to build and expand your personal sanctuary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming and Cultivation</strong>: Plant and nurture a variety of crops, designing and managing your own farm. Protect your plants from pests and ensure a thriving ecosystem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Freedom</strong>: With the core theme of &quot;Your World,&quot; shape the environment to your vision. Build unique structures, design intricate landscapes, and create a world that reflects your imagination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive VR Experience</strong>: Experience survival like never before with VR gameplay that places you at the heart of a stylized, enchanting world. Every action, from crafting to farming, is designed to be intuitive and immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In <strong>Your World</strong>, the only limit is your creativity. Prepare to build, survive, and thrive in a realm where your imagination shapes the adventure.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a surreal journey in <strong>Your World</strong>, a VR survival game that blends open-world exploration with a dreamlike, low-poly aesthetic. Immerse yourself in a vibrant landscape where every element is crafted to inspire creativity and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather and Craft</strong>: Collect resources from the environment to craft essential tools and structures. Chop trees, mine stones, and forge metal components to build and expand your personal sanctuary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming and Cultivation</strong>: Plant and nurture a variety of crops, designing and managing your own farm. Protect your plants from pests and ensure a thriving ecosystem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Freedom</strong>: With the core theme of &quot;Your World,&quot; shape the environment to your vision. Build unique structures, design intricate landscapes, and create a world that reflects your imagination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive VR Experience</strong>: Experience survival like never before with VR gameplay that places you at the heart of a stylized, enchanting world. Every action, from crafting to farming, is designed to be intuitive and immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In <strong>Your World</strong>, the only limit is your creativity. Prepare to build, survive, and thrive in a realm where your imagination shapes the adventure.</i></p>",
